@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title after_event 跟踪器随 VM 扫描暂存
participant "运行时宿主\n(ControlRuntime)" as Host
participant "Rust AfterEventRuntime\n(WASM)" as AE
participant "Rust VM" as VM
Host -> AE : 暂存显式事件事实\n与测量的谓词观测
AE --> Host : Rust 所有的 any/all 结果
Host -> VM : 以私有生成的 Result 输入\n携带结果执行扫描
alt VM 扫描提交
  VM --> Host : 已提交
  Host -> AE : 提交跟踪器状态
else VM 扫描被拒绝
  VM --> Host : 被拒绝
  Host -> AE : 回滚跟踪器状态
end
@enduml
